{"id":"n61533-1-16","stage":1,"title":"기뻐하다 · 高兴","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61533-1-16-1","ko":"아내한테 무슨 선물을 주면 기뻐할까?","zh":"该送什么礼物给妻子，她才会高兴呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아내한테","meaning":"妻子，爱人，老婆","explanation":"아내：妻子，爱人，老婆；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"아내","audio":"/audio/3611acca94af861ef852.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30196","senseId":"1","lemma":"아내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선물을","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주면","meaning":"使感到，使受到，带来","explanation":"주다：使感到，使受到，带来；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"3","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기뻐할까?","meaning":"高兴，欢喜","explanation":"기뻐하다：高兴，欢喜；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"기뻐하다","audio":"/audio/951b3e791dc729ca8f58.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61533","senseId":"1","lemma":"기뻐하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3611acca94af861e","term":"아내","zh":"妻子，爱人，老婆","audio":"/audio/3611acca94af861ef852.mp3","entryId":"30196","definition":"结婚而成为男子的配偶的女人。","pronunciation":["아내"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"使感到，使受到，带来","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"让别人经历某事或产生某种情绪。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"951b3e791dc729ca","term":"기뻐하다","zh":"高兴，欢喜","audio":"/audio/951b3e791dc729ca8f58.mp3","entryId":"61533","definition":"觉得愉快而兴奋。","pronunciation":["기뻐하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/81654c691c90077569e2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61533-1-16-2","ko":"그냥 넌지시 물어보면 어때?","zh":"干脆委婉地问问看怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그냥","meaning":"随便","explanation":"그냥：随便","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"4","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넌지시","meaning":"悄悄地，偷偷地","explanation":"넌지시：悄悄地，偷偷地","readings":[{"term":"넌지시","audio":"/audio/6f9e31a5615a12c35746.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42810","senseId":"1","lemma":"넌지시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물어보면","meaning":"问，打听","explanation":"물어보다：问，打听；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"물어보다","audio":"/audio/d3dc601f766896a3ecf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69473","senseId":"1","lemma":"물어보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"随便","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"没有任何想法或别意地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"6f9e31a5615a12c3","term":"넌지시","zh":"悄悄地，偷偷地","audio":"/audio/6f9e31a5615a12c35746.mp3","entryId":"42810","definition":"不露声色，很隐秘地。","pronunciation":["넌지시"]},{"id":"d3dc601f766896a3","term":"물어보다","zh":"问，打听","audio":"/audio/d3dc601f766896a3ecf1.mp3","entryId":"69473","definition":"为弄清某事而发问。","pronunciation":["무러보다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","